    "title": "IVAC announces the 2025 additions to 40 Under Forty, Community Cornerstone honorees - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brandon LaChance ,\n1 days ago The Illinois Valley Area Chamber of Commerce has announced its 2025 Champions of Change through its annual acknowledgments, 40 Under Forty and Community Cornerstones. Those honored highlighted innovation, service, leadership and a commitment to community. IVAC Executive Director Bill Zens stated the recognition reflects what they've accomplished and the lasting impact they continue to make every day. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
